// Repro from #64701
// Checking `ReturnType<typeof createHandler>` relates the generic signature of
// `createHandler` to the signature in the `extends` clause of `ReturnType`, which
// instantiates it in the context of that signature. Inferring between the type
// arguments of nested instantiations of the same type aliases used to recurse
// through inferFromTypes and inferFromTypeArguments without terminating.

